Subject: [PATCH] bridge: preserve typed NSS FDB events and refresh lifetime

Send complete synchronous move events with the original port preserved. Replaced
remote entries becoming local use the existing delete chain. Cover administrative
and external-learn replacements and keep ageing on its single delete event.
Protect NSS refresh lookups for the lifetime of the bridge port.

--- a/net/bridge/br_fdb.c
